{"ref":"BDB, בִּנּוּי","hw":"בִּנּוּי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בִּנּוּי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  head of a family that returned with Zerubbabel <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.15\">Ne 7:15</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּני</span> ‖ <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:10\" href=\"/Ezra.2.10\">Ezr 2:10</a> & perhaps <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:34\" href=\"/Ezra.10.34\">Ezr 10:34</a> cf. Sm<sup>Listen 14</sup>; but BeRy proposes here <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּגְוַי</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  a Levite of Ezra’s time <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:33\" href=\"/Ezra.8.33\">Ezr 8:33</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.10\">Ne 10:10</a> (prob. = <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.7\">8:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בֻּנִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.4\">9:4</a>) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.8\">12:8</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:24\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.24\">3:24</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">בַּוַי</span>, textual error v <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:18\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.18\">18</a>) v. BeRy; also <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:40\" href=\"/Ezra.2.40\">Ezr 2:40</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:42\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.42\">Ne 7:43</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">לִבְנֵי</span> read perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבִנֻּי</span> cf. Sm<sup>Listen 16</sup> but BeRy otherwise; cf. further Gr<sup>Gesch. ii, 2, 389</sup>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  Israelites of Ezra’s time, <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:30\" href=\"/Ezra.10.30\">Ezr 10:30</a>; <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:38\" href=\"/Ezra.10.38\">Ezr 10:38</a>.","next":"BDB, בָּנִי","prev":"BDB, בּוּנִּי²"}